# The motivating machine, replayed: idle build daemons, agent sessions, the Claude VM — then Reclaim.
Output docs/media/tui-replay.gif
Set Width 1640
Set Height 960
Source docs/tapes/_setup.tape
Source docs/tapes/_replay.tape
Hide
Type "export OOMTOP_GENERAL__OTHER_USERS=false; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "oomtop"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "5"
Sleep 3.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "4"
Sleep 3s
Type "3"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "1"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 400ms
